id           = CWE-1074
name         = Class with Excessively Deep Inheritance
abstraction  = Base
structure    = Simple
status       = Incomplete

description : A class has an inheritance level that is too high, i.e., it has a large number of parent classes.

extended description : While the interpretation of "large number of parent classes" may vary for each product or developer, CISQ recommends a default maximum of 7 parent classes.

notes : https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/1074.html
